### The Problem

I was ready to verify the PR; however, there seems to be an issue. Not with the PR per se, but rather the verification has highlighted an existing issue with the delete annotation and the way the CVO acts during a cluster installation.

---

### Verification Process

The CI Jobs verify the approved changes.

* e2e-agnostic-ovn verifies that the CVO has the needed permissions
* e2e-agnostic-ovn-upgrade-into-change verifies the into transition, which is critical
* e2e-agnostic-ovn-upgrade-out-of-change verifies installation, the rollback transition, and verifies the update-payload Pod functionality 



